            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/8ae1546a3247dc16c73ffcba822c69ae.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/8ae1546a3247dc16c73ffcba822c69ae.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/8ae1546a3247dc16c73ffcba822c69ae.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update brings a major graphics overhaul: reworked lighting, landscapes and effects, dynamic water, and improved shadows! In addition, the new “Whispers of the Wasteland” event with a “cust.” version of the “Snowfall” rocket launcher, a Halloween event, an updated Clan war mode, new and reworked brawls, and a number of UI improvements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out more on the official Crossout website!</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junte-se ao CROSSOUT Remastered, o jogo MMO de Ação pós-apocalíptico! Crie sua máquina de batalha a partir de dezena de partes, entre diretamente em combate e destrua seus inimigos em explosivas batalhas PvP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Funcionalidades chave:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veículos únicos, feitos pelos jogadores usando uma vasta gama de partes disponíveis: Desde os bugies aos pesados sobre esteiras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberdade total com milhares de combinações possíveis: Crie veículos de qualquer forma com dezenas de armaduras, armamentos e sistemas de apoio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modelo de dano avançado: A destruição de qualquer parte das máquinas inimigas afetará o seu desempenho.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enorme arsenal: Desde moto-serras, brocas, metralhadoras, lança-rockets, drones e geradores de camuflagem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oficina própria: Crie novas partes e coloque-as em leilão no mercado de jogo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comércio entre os jogadores: Cada peça que você ganha em batalha pode ser vendida a outros jogadores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CROSSOUT - The Road to Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2027 a mysterious viral epidemic known as the ‘Crossout’ swept the planet, countries and populations simultaneously began to fall at an alarming rate all over the Earth. Those who did not die in the first few days, were plagued by hallucinations and headaches, many people went mad, others and committed suicide. The source of the disease could not be detected but the cities that were once the vibrant social and economic beacons of humanity were left ravaged and deserted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors gradually began to change — after fifteen years of transformation, the changes became visible. The most noticeable metamorphosis occurred in the eyes of the affected — some began to glow, while others resembled black holes. To hide their unnatural looks and conceal the mutation, people started wearing padded clothing and sunglasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years have passed after ‘Crossout’. Humans still remember their life before the disaster. As always, there are groups trying to recover the old world, while others enjoy the chaos and destruction. But there are those who are not human any more. They hide their faces behind masks, and their motives are unknown.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/6538e27cb6bf55d8aa2312940a1e2ed0.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junte-se ao CROSSOUT Remastered, o jogo MMO de Ação pós-apocalíptico! Crie sua máquina de batalha a partir de dezena de partes, entre diretamente em combate e destrua seus inimigos em explosivas batalhas PvP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Funcionalidades chave:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/b1e73faec5755da819ebd013a625dfe6.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veículos únicos, feitos pelos jogadores usando uma vasta gama de partes disponíveis: Desde os bugies aos pesados sobre esteiras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberdade total com milhares de combinações possíveis: Crie veículos de qualquer forma com dezenas de armaduras, armamentos e sistemas de apoio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modelo de dano avançado: A destruição de qualquer parte das máquinas inimigas afetará o seu desempenho.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enorme arsenal: Desde moto-serras, brocas, metralhadoras, lança-rockets, drones e geradores de camuflagem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oficina própria: Crie novas partes e coloque-as em leilão no mercado de jogo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comércio entre os jogadores: Cada peça que você ganha em batalha pode ser vendida a outros jogadores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CROSSOUT - The Road to Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.poster.avif?t=1793693049\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.webm?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386180/extras/05883db565d50b929ce2ac3a1a338526.mp4?t=1793693049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2027 a mysterious viral epidemic known as the ‘Crossout’ swept the planet, countries and populations simultaneously began to fall at an alarming rate all over the Earth. Those who did not die in the first few days, were plagued by hallucinations and headaches, many people went mad, others and committed suicide. The source of the disease could not be detected but the cities that were once the vibrant social and economic beacons of humanity were left ravaged and deserted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors gradually began to change — after fifteen years of transformation, the changes became visible. The most noticeable metamorphosis occurred in the eyes of the affected — some began to glow, while others resembled black holes. To hide their unnatural looks and conceal the mutation, people started wearing padded clothing and sunglasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years have passed after ‘Crossout’. Humans still remember their life before the disaster. As always, there are groups trying to recover the old world, while others enjoy the chaos and destruction. But there are those who are not human any more. They hide their faces behind masks, and their motives are unknown.</p>",
